  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Confucianism has been followed by Chinese people for more than 2,000 years, and it has influenced Chinese culture throughout this era.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In modern socialism, Confucian values continue to guide how we treat others.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Confucianism teaches Ren, Yi, Li, Ji and Xin, which are general virtues around the world.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "According to Confucius, a wise and respected teacher, Ren is the feeling of care and love we should have for others.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "It can be as simple as giving care to a neighbour who has a fever, but it promotes friendship and harmony so that some wars may be avoided.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Confucius said, \"What you do not want done to yourself, do not do to others.\"",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "It is quite similar to the golden rule in western countries, which encourages people to be friendly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The meaning of Yi is a little harder to express.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "It can be thought of as duty or even respect.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "While Ren is mostly about our opinions and feelings, Yi is about how we should act.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Generally, Yi is the way we should connect with people.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "For example, we say polite words such as pardon or excuse me to show our respect.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "In Confucian writings, discussions about Yi also include how to remember ancestors.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Xin emphasises that one should be honest in relationships.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "This means we shouldn't ever lie or cheat.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "In this way, we can build strong and lasting relationships with others.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Perhaps the most well-known Confucian virtue is Xiao.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Xiao means loving, respecting, obeying and taking care of one's parents, as well as grandfather and grandmother.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Xiao is important for a harmonious society.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Without it, the whole world would fall into a mess.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
